OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry in the morning with
OL,6,Fjust the odd shower and winds
OL,7,Fcontinuing to ease. Rain will spread
OL,8,Fnorth into Orkney in the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith strengthening southeasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain across Orkney will
OL,12,Fquickly move up into Shetland before
OL,13,Fclearing away north. Some blustery
OL,14,Fshowers will follow from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest. Strong southerly winds with
OL,16,Fgales developing overnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FSome brightness at first,
OL,19,Fotherwise mainly cloudy with showers
OL,20,For longer spells of rain. Severe gale
OL,21,Fforce southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
