OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and showers on Wednesday then
OL,7,Fmainly dry and bright on Thursday and
OL,8,FFriday. Gales easing on Wednesday
OL,9,Fmorning but staying rather breezy
OL,10,Fthereafter.
